@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Get a development token
# @name token
POST {{host}}/api/v1/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Submit a valid transaction
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "partnerId": "P-1001",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-99823",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}

### 3. Submit an invalid transaction (negative amount + bad currency)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "partnerId": "P-1001",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-1",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}

### 4. Hit the mock verification API directly (30% timeouts)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/mock/partners/P-1001
